public class settlement_NpcInitializers extends GhidraScript{public void run()throws Exception{TreeMap<Long,Function>fs=new TreeMap<>();for(long a=0x6150ea0;a<0x6150ec8;a++)for(Reference r:getReferencesTo(toAddr(a))){Function f=getFunctionContaining(r.getFromAddress());if(f!=null)fs.put(f.getEntryPoint().getOffset(),f);}getFunctionAt(toAddr(0x58a0ae)).setCallFixup("security_check_cookie");DecompInterface dc=new DecompInterface();DecompileOptions opt=new DecompileOptions();opt.setMaxPayloadMBytes(256);dc.setOptions(opt);dc.openProgram(currentProgram);try(PrintWriter o=new PrintWriter(Files.newBufferedWriter(Path.of(getScriptArgs()[0]),StandardCharsets.UTF_8))){for(Function f:fs.values()){o.println("\n/* Function "+f.getEntryPoint()+" */");DecompileResults r=dc.decompileFunction(f,120,monitor);o.println(r.getDecompiledFunction()==null?r.getErrorMessage():r.getDecompiledFunction().getC());o.flush();println("NPC "+f.getEntryPoint());}}finally{dc.dispose();}}}
